    "detailed_description": "<strong>TrophyRC</strong> is an exciting off-road simulation game featuring radio-controlled models, where you can test your driving skills and explore new horizons.<br><br><strong>Extreme Off-Roading:</strong> Challenge your skills on complex tracks filled with obstacles and rough terrain. Each race tests your precision and attention to detail \u2014 remember, speed isn\u2019t everything here!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/8f5dc3c6673a7e2e14a2769b3ad74dc9.poster.avif?t=1724864966\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/8f5dc3c6673a7e2e14a2769b3ad74dc9.webm?t=1724864966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/8f5dc3c6673a7e2e14a2769b3ad74dc9.mp4?t=1724864966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong> Tracks for Every Taste: Head out onto meticulously designed tracks where every turn and obstacle will test your expertise.<br><br><strong>Open World:</strong> Explore vast territories, discover uncharted routes, and enjoy true freedom of movement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/625cf1630c1c1e9397d833d60170a499.poster.avif?t=1724864966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/625cf1630c1c1e9397d833d60170a499.webm?t=1724864966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115870/extras/625cf1630c1c1e9397d833d60170a499.mp4?t=1724864966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Vehicle Customization:</strong> Personalize your car by modifying technical parameters such as suspension, engine, and transmission. Change your car's appearance to stand out on the track or simply express your individuality.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Join friends or other players from around the world. Participate in races, organize competitions, or just explore the world together.<br><br><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> We strive to offer highly detailed driving physics that considers all the specifics and nuances of each track section and surface. You can connect a radio control transmitter for an authentic experience.",
